# UI PR Contract

- Use `.agent/skills/unslop` plus impeccable / design-taste on any UI change.
- Facts from code. `.agent/DESIGN.md` is the contract. Tokens only in `frontend/src/app.css`.
- Use host tokens — do not invent a palette.
- One global Button owns lighting (gradient, insets, outer drop; press = translateY(1px) only).
- Bans: no Popover split buttons; no oversized fields; no second-hue focus ring; no 24/12 card lift; no press-scale; no spinner→check.
- Do not add gitleaks/knip/jscpd/osv-scanner/lefthook unless asked.
- Do not merge unless asked.
